{"title":"2017 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/a/e6a9f7c0a5831469b8180348daf87510d41fd6db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5^{2} - 9}{5 - 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"54\" height=\"42\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/7/d0773b11da3abd31200597f415f8cd9058263a18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 4 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 2 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ \\frac{1}{2} \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 8 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ -2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"414\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/0/0b0586effc9eb5f958e21cc51d2f3020fbed59a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5^{2} - 9}{5 - 3} = \\frac{25 - 9}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"131\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/c/1dc505dad540b7ee1d3420632100f156ca7b2204.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{16}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"43\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/c/49c9e22e392fc2507f36ea15f82601697ea4009c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"77\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/2/d22c2e3aedc71091e600748490403152bc4ef396.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5^{2} - 9}{5 - 3} = \\frac{5^{2} - 3^{2}}{5 - 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"137\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/7/4f753d7e3b9aedab4ed8e2aef1f218704e815212.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{(5 - 3)(5 + 3)}{5 - 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"134\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/0/220d670686606415b3e233383ff89a3c75750aac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=5 + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"61\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/c/49c9e22e392fc2507f36ea15f82601697ea4009c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"77\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"2017 CEMC Cayley\">2017 CEMC Cayley</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Cayley_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Cayley Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Cayley_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Cayley Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=